        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) Filling a Job Vacancy by Advanced Assignment – With the exception of the Customer Service Department, after such movement as provided in paragraph 3) above, the vacancy shall be filled by advanced assignment in accordance with the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
